Solari Sub-surface is a small shipping company that works to fill the gaps left in the market by larger players like [[Org/Prime Meridian/index|Prime Meridian]] and [[Org/Alkahest Freight/index|Alkahest Freight]].

Aboard the [[Phenomena/Pilgrimage|pilgrimage]] it joined the Party's alliance, and its people moved to the Party's berth. Its own Heart was given up to [[Org/Iconoclasm/Eerie|Eerie]] and its berth left behind, and the [[Org/Protectorate/index|Protectorate]] took the territory.
